      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dayton%2C_Nevada"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1849 Abner Blackburn discovered Nevada's first gold at Gold Canyon, just above present‑day Dayton.",
